  "notes": "Near-monochrome zinc UI on #f6f6f6 where all colour comes from generated cover art (gradient squares with circles, stripes, tilted frames and waves). The only brand colour is a very dark brown #2c1513 used for the primary '立即播放' pill and the playback progress line atop the player bar. Sidebar active item uses a light warm-grey fill with a thin dark left indicator. Section headers are bold 18px titles with tiny grey subtitles. Album/playlist covers are 12px-rounded squares; artists are circles with initial glyph. Round 40px grey icon buttons in the toolbar; desktop window controls (min/max/close) live in the top-right, revealing it as an Electron/Tauri desktop app. Hero content is randomized per load. Search trigger opens a Cmd-K-style palette with '/' command mode and keyboard hints."
